{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01185",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.98,
      "end_seconds": 3.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Good afternoon, how are you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.23,
      "end_seconds": 7.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "Morning, doctor, sorry about the rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 12.83,
      "end_seconds": 18.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.61,
      "text": "Good morning, um, doctor. I came along to help out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.05,
      "end_seconds": 21.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "where shall we begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.72,
      "end_seconds": 29.29,
      "duration_seconds": 5.57,
      "text": "So the thing is, I've got an itchy patch on my wrist."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.13,
      "end_seconds": 34.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.64,
      "end_seconds": 45.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.28,
      "text": "Three days, I think... sorry, ten days, I got that wrong."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.24,
      "end_seconds": 51.56,
      "duration_seconds": 5.32,
      "text": "Understood. Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.19,
      "end_seconds": 81.34,
      "duration_seconds": 28.15,
      "text": "yes, my new watch strap that makes it worse it comes and goes. Severe, really and a bit of redness, too as for dry flaky skin, I honestly can't say when that began it might have been last month or the the month before with dry flaky skin, maybe a five out of ten on a bad day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.35,
      "end_seconds": 86.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "And what about fever or blisters?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.95,
      "end_seconds": 91.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "no fever or blisters, none of it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.28,
      "end_seconds": 95.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Have you had spreading, by any chance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.43,
      "end_seconds": 98.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "No. No spreading."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.42,
      "end_seconds": 105.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "Have you noticed any weakness, or anything odd with your balance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.65,
      "end_seconds": 108.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.17,
      "end_seconds": 113.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.03,
      "end_seconds": 117.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Depression, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.45,
      "end_seconds": 121.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 122.55,
      "end_seconds": 127.89,
      "duration_seconds": 5.34,
      "text": "she takes fluoxetine, 20 milligrams, every morning for my mood"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.93,
      "end_seconds": 135.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "roughly how long on that one?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 137.17,
      "end_seconds": 145.88,
      "duration_seconds": 8.71,
      "text": "About two months. She is on a plain moisturiser, twice a day, I give it to her."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.66,
      "end_seconds": 150.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.87,
      "end_seconds": 154.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.03,
      "end_seconds": 158.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "do you work outside the home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.44,
      "end_seconds": 164.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.88,
      "end_seconds": 169.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "Alright, what does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.7,
      "end_seconds": 174.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.2,
      "end_seconds": 191.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.99,
      "end_seconds": 195.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "My grandmother had dementia."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.2,
      "end_seconds": 215.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.23,
      "end_seconds": 223.36,
      "duration_seconds": 6.13,
      "text": "I'm allergic to nickel, I get a rash on my skin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.54,
      "end_seconds": 227.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.69,
      "end_seconds": 239.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Right, sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.73,
      "end_seconds": 262.24,
      "duration_seconds": 7.51,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 86 beats a minute, temperature 36.5, blood pressure 128 over 82."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.7,
      "end_seconds": 267.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Okay, shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.28,
      "end_seconds": 270.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.62,
      "end_seconds": 290.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.68,
      "text": "There's a neat red patch where the watch strap sits, with a little scaling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.83,
      "end_seconds": 303.44,
      "duration_seconds": 10.61,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me. So where does that leave us? The most likely explanation is mild contact dermatitis from the watch strap."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.78,
      "end_seconds": 330.69,
      "duration_seconds": 13.91,
      "text": "What I'm giving you is hydrocortisone cream, 1%, once a day, one week. That should help with contact dermatitis. Stop wearing that strap and keep the skin moisturised."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.02,
      "end_seconds": 340.86,
      "duration_seconds": 9.84,
      "text": "Hm, okay. Come back if it has not cleared in two weeks. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 342.17,
      "end_seconds": 345.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.1,
      "end_seconds": 347.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
}